OL,3,GNEWSA'Bitter disappointment' as bypass
OL,4,Aplan is dropped
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council leader said he was
OL,7,Fdisappointed the government had dropped
OL,8,Fa long-planned bypass from its national
OL,9,Ffunding programme.
OL,11,FThe A509 Isham bypass was first
OL,12,Fproposed in 2003 by the now defunct
OL,13,FNorthamptonshire County Council, but it
OL,14,Fwas delayed by funding problems.
