OL,3,GNEWSA'Bitter disappointment' as bypass
OL,4,Aplan is dropped
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Friday, it was removed from the
OL,7,FMajor Road Network and Large Local
OL,8,FMajors Programme, after a review by the
OL,9,FDepartment for Transport (DfT). North
OL,10,FNorthamptonshire Council leader Martin
OL,11,FGriffiths said he shared "the bitter
OL,12,Fdisappointment" of residents who had
OL,13,Fwaited "many years" for the road.
OL,15,FA DfT spokesperson said it could only
OL,16,Fgo ahead with schemes that were "good
OL,17,Fvalue for money".
